    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n26230" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διαφορ-ητικός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>promoting perspiration,</i> etc., <i><span class="en">
				Antyll.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Orib.
				6.21.30
			</span></i>: 
				Comp.
			, <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				1.30
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>capable of dispersing, discutient,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δύναμις δ. οἰδημάτων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					4.112
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				13.925
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>perspiring,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Cael.Aur.
				<u>CP</u>
				2.36
			</span></i>.</div>
